# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Robber of the Rich, Rogue to Goblin (CR 612.1). It attacks, exiles the top
# card of Bot2's library (Bot2 holds more cards), and "during any turn you attacked with a Goblin" Bot1 may cast that
# card: Robber is the Goblin it attacked with, so Bot1 casts Mox Pearl from exile. Read as printed, Robber is no Rogue
# any more and the card could not be cast.

